elcome sign that biden put  out there  and he shut everything down that trump  was doing that was working before  it's the mess now as you know the  president of the white house  has pointed to this happening many times  in the past  that there was a spike in this activity  uh back in 2019  and they blamed at the time president  trump cutting 450 billion dollars  in funding uh to mexico do you buy that  do you believe that  if you look at the map uh ron johnson  did it  lindsey graham and uh we've used it  often right here  it shows all the peaks and valleys and  the most recent one  would have been when trump started  talking about  staying place in mexico of course there  was a surge  because what impressed me most are the  people  on the other side that are making 4 000  bucks ahead  on any central american and mexican  that's per  person not family up to 20 000  on other nationalities if they can pay  more and they've got a logistics  system deal that knows how to work  the system when you give them the  opportunity it was at a 45-year  low which president biden failed to  mention  when you had the wall belt to the extent  even though you got  gaps in it where he shut it down and you  had  placement in mexico where you weren't  let into the country and you were  working with the northern triangle  countries biden politically said  we're stopping it because it was trump  he's got a fiasco  that 17 other senators witnessed as well  senator uh there are estimates here that  the number of kids crossing the border  could keep  soaring uh one study has it at as many  as 18 to 22  000 at the border in april another 25  000 in may there's no way we can keep up  with that  there's not the total figures february  was about a hundred thousand  it's going to hit about 140 000 in march  this is along the whole sector of the  southern border  texas has got four or five separate  sections themselves  and quarter million is what the border  patrol  said they're bracing for and 